@startuml usecase
!include _style.puml
title 图2.1　麒麟安全智能运维 Agent 用例图

left to right direction

actor "运维管理员" as Admin
actor "攻击者" as Attacker #FCEAEA
actor "DeepSeek 大模型" as LLM
actor "麒麟操作系统" as OS

rectangle "麒麟安全智能运维 Agent" {
  usecase "自然语言运维对话" as UC_Chat
  usecase "查询系统实时状态\n（OS 感知）" as UC_Sense
  usecase "智能根因分析" as UC_Diag
  usecase "执行受控处置动作" as UC_Act
  usecase "思维链审计回放" as UC_Audit
  usecase "护栏规则热加载" as UC_Rules
  usecase "MCP 工具供应链扫描" as UC_Scan

  usecase "意图风险过滤" as UC_Intent
  usecase "提示词注入防御" as UC_Inject
  usecase "命令护栏二次校验" as UC_Guard
  usecase "最小权限校验" as UC_Priv
  usecase "强制二次确认" as UC_Confirm
  usecase "危险操作拦截" as UC_Block
}

Admin --> UC_Chat
Admin --> UC_Sense
Admin --> UC_Diag
Admin --> UC_Act
Admin --> UC_Audit
Admin --> UC_Rules
Admin --> UC_Scan

Attacker ..> UC_Inject : 威胁
Attacker ..> UC_Chat : 诱导越权

UC_Chat ..> UC_Intent : <<include>>
UC_Chat ..> UC_Inject : <<include>>
UC_Chat ..> UC_Sense : <<include>>
UC_Act ..> UC_Confirm : <<include>>
UC_Act ..> UC_Guard : <<include>>
UC_Act ..> UC_Priv : <<include>>
UC_Block ..> UC_Act : <<extend>>
UC_Block ..> UC_Chat : <<extend>>

UC_Sense --> OS
UC_Diag --> OS
UC_Act --> OS
UC_Chat --> LLM

note bottom of UC_Block
  危险命令 / 提权 / 注入命中规则时，
  拦截行为在执行点被触发（扩展用例）
end note
@enduml
